  },
  "controlled_change": "only the bottleneck module differs; encoder, decoder, skips, head, data, optimiser, schedule identical",
  "architecture": "4-stage U-Net encoder (32,64,128,256) of DoubleConv [Conv3x3(no bias)+BN+ReLU]x2, MaxPool2x2; bottleneck 512ch at 1/16 resolution; decoder ConvTranspose2d 2x2 s2 + concat skip + DoubleConv x4; 1x1 head",
